{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_1","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"◎地理五","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_2","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"江浙等處行中書省，為路三十、府一、州二，屬州二十六，屬縣一百四十三。（本省陆站一百八十處，水站八十二處。）","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_3","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"江南浙西道肅政廉訪司","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_4","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"杭州路，（上。）唐初為杭州，後改餘杭郡，又仍為杭州。五代錢鎦據兩浙，號吳越國。宋高宗南渡，都之，為臨安府。元至元十三年，平江南，立兩浙都督府，又改為安撫司。十五年，改為杭州路總管府。二十一年，自扬州遷江淮行省來治於杭，改曰江浙行省。本路戶三十六萬八百五十，口一百八十三萬四千七百一十。（至元二十七年抄籍數。）領司二、縣八、州一。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_5","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"左、右錄事司。（宋高宗建炎三年，遷都杭州，設九厢。元至元十四年，分為四隅錄事司。泰定二年，併為左右二錄事司。）","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_6","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣八","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_7","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錢塘，（上。）仁和，（上。與錢塘分治城下。）餘杭，（中。）臨安，（中。）新城，（中。）富陽，（中。）於潛，（中。）昌化。（中。）","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_8","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州一","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_9","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"海寧州，（中。）唐以來為鹽官縣。元元貞元年，以戶口繁多，升為鹽官州。（是年，升江南平陽等縣為州，以戶為差，戶至四萬五萬者為下州，五萬至十萬者為中州。凡為中州者二十八，下州者十五。）泰定四年，海圮鹽官。天歷二年，改海寧州。海寧東南皆濱巨海，自唐、宋常有水患，大德、延祐間亦嘗被其害。泰定四年春，其害尤甚，命都水少監張仲仁往治之，沿海三十餘里下石囤四十四萬三千三百有奇，木櫃四百七十餘，工役萬人。文宗即位，水势始平，乃罢役，故改曰海寧雲。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_10","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"湖州路，（上。）唐改吳興郡，又改湖州。宋改安吉州。至元十三年，升湖州路。戶二十五萬四千三百四十五。（抄籍戶口數闕，用至順錢糧數。）領司一、縣五、州一。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_11","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（舊設東西南北四厢。至元十三年，立總督四厢。十四年，改錄事司。）","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_12","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_13","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"乌程，（上。）歸安，（上。與乌程皆為倚郭。）安吉，（中。）德清，（下。）武康。（中。）","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_14","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州一","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_15","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"長興州，（中。）唐為綏州，又更名雉州，又為長城縣。朱梁改曰長興。宋因之。元元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_16","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"嘉興路，（上。）唐為嘉興縣。石晉置秀州。宋為嘉禾郡，又升嘉興府。戶四十二萬六千六百五十六，口二百二十四萬五千七百四十二。領司一、縣一、州二。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_17","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（舊置厢官，元初改為兵馬司。至元十四年，置錄事司。）","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_18","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣一","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_19","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"嘉興。（上。倚郭。）","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_20","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_21","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"海鹽州，（中。）唐為縣，宋因之。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_22","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"崇德州，（中。）石晉置，宋因之。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_23","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"平江路，（上。）唐初為蘇州，又改吳郡，又仍為蘇州。宋為平江府。元至元十三年升平江路。戶四十六萬六千一百五十八，口二百四十三萬三千七百。領司一、縣二、州四。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_24","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_25","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣二","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_26","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"吳縣，（上。）長洲。（上。與吳縣併為倚郭。）","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_27","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州四","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_28","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"崑山州，（中。）唐以來為縣，元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_29","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"常熟州，（中。）唐以來為縣，元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_30","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"吳江州，（中。）唐以來為縣，元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_31","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"嘉定州，（中。）本崑山縣地，宋置縣，元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_32","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"常州路，（上。）唐初為常州，又改晉陵郡，又复為常州，宋因之。元至元十四年升為路。戶二十萬九千七百三十二，口一百二萬一十一。領司一、縣二、州二。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_33","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_34","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣二","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_35","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"晉陵，（中。倚郭。）武進。（中。倚郭。）","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_36","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_37","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"宜興州，（中。）唐義興縣。宋改義為宜。元至元十五年，升宜興府。二十年，仍為縣。二十一年，复升為府，仍置宜興縣以隸之。元貞元年，府縣俱废，止立宜興州。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_38","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"無錫州，（中。）唐無錫縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_39","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"镇江路，（下。）唐润州，又改丹陽郡，又為镇海軍。宋為镇江府。元至元十三年，升為镇江路。戶一十萬三千三百一十五，口六十二萬三千六百四十四。領司一、縣三。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_40","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_41","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣三","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_42","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"丹徒，（中。倚郭。）丹陽，（中。）金壇。（中。）","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_43","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"建德路，（上。）唐睦州，又為嚴州，又改新定郡。宋為建德軍，又為遂安軍，後升建德府。元至元十三年，改建德府安撫司。十四年，改建德路。戶一十萬三千四百八十一，口五十萬四千二百六十四。領司一、縣六。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_44","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_45","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣六","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_46","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"建德，（中。倚郭。）淳安，（中。）遂安，（下。）桐庐，（中。）分水，（中。）寿昌。（中。）","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_47","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"松江府，唐為蘇州屬邑。宋為秀州屬邑。元至元十四年，升為華亭府。十五年，改松江府，仍置華亭縣以隸之。戶一十六萬三千九百三十一。（至順錢糧數。）領縣二：","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_48","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"華亭，（上。倚郭。）上海。（上。本華亭縣地，至元二十七年，以戶口繁多，置上海縣，屬松江府。）","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_49","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"江陰州，（上。）唐初為暨州，後為江陰縣，隸常州。宋為軍。元至元十二年，依舊置軍，行安撫司事。十四年，升為江陰路總管府，今降為江陰州。戶五萬三千八百二十一，口三十萬一百七十七。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_50","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"浙東道宣慰司都元帥府（元治婺州，大德六年移治慶元。）","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_51","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"慶元路，（上。）唐為鄞州，又為明州，又為餘姚郡。宋升慶元府。元至元十三年，改置宣慰司。十四年，改為慶元路總管府。戶二十四萬一千四百五十七，口五十一萬一千一百一十三。領司一、縣四、州二。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_52","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_53","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣四","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_54","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"鄞縣，（上。倚郭。）象山，（中。）慈溪，（中。）定海。（中。）","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_55","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_56","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"奉化州，（下。）唐析鄮縣地置奉化縣，隸明州。元元貞元年，升為奉化州，隸慶元。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_57","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"昌國州，（下。）宋置昌國縣。元至元十四年，升為州，仍置昌國縣以隸之。後止立昌國州，隸慶元。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_58","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"衢州路，（上。）本太末地，唐析婺州之西境置衢州，又改信安郡，又改為衢州。元至元十三年，改衢州路總管府。戶一十萬八千五百六十七，口五十四萬三千六百六十。領司一、縣五。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_59","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_60","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_61","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"西安，（中。倚郭。）龍遊，（上。）江山，（下。）常山，（下。宋改信安，今复舊名。）开化。（中。）","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_62","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"浙東海右道肅政廉訪司","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_63","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"婺州路，（上。）唐初為婺州，又改東陽郡。宋為保寧軍。元至元十三年，改婺州路。戶二十二萬一千一百一十八，口一百七萬七千五百四十。領司一、縣六、州一。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_64","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_65","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣六","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_66","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"金華，（上。倚郭。）東陽，（上。）義乌，（上。）永康，（中。）武義，（中。）浦江。（中。）","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_67","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州一","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_68","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"蘭溪州，（下。）本金華之西部三河戍，唐析置蘭溪縣，宋因之。元元貞元年，升州。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_69","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"紹興路，（上。）唐初為越州，又改會稽郡，又仍為越州。宋為紹興府。元至元十三年，改紹興路。戶一十五萬一千二百三十四，口五十二萬一千五百八十八。領司一、縣六、州二。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_70","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_71","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣六","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_72","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"山陰，（上。）會稽，（中。與山陰俱倚郭。有會稽山為南镇。）上虞，（上。）萧山，（中。）嵊縣，（上。）新昌。（中。）","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_73","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_74","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"餘姚州，（下。）唐餘姚縣，宋因之。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_75","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"諸暨州，（下。）宋諸暨縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_76","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"溫州路，（上。）唐初為東嘉州，又改永嘉郡，又為溫州。宋升瑞安府。元至元十三年，置溫州路。戶一十八萬七千四百三，口四十九萬七千八百四十八。領司一、縣二、州二。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_77","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_78","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣二","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_79","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"永嘉，（上。倚郭。）樂清。（下。）","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_80","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_81","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"瑞安州，（下。）唐瑞安縣，宋因之。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_82","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"平陽州，（下。）唐平陽縣，宋因之。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_83","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"台州路，（上。）唐初為海州，复改台州，又改臨海郡，又為德化軍，宋因之。元至元十三年，置安撫司。十四年，改台州路總管府。戶一十九萬六千四百一十五，口一百萬三千八百三十三。領司一、縣四、州一。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_84","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_85","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣四","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_86","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"臨海，（上。倚郭。）仙居，（上。）寧海，（上。）天台。（中。）","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_87","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州一","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_88","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"黃巖州，（下。）唐為縣，宋因之。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_89","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"處州路，（上。）唐初為括州，又改縉雲郡，又為處州，宋因之。元至元十三年，立處州路總管府。戶一十三萬二千七百五十四，口四十九萬三千六百九十二。領司一、縣七。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_90","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_91","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣七","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_92","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"麗水，（中。倚郭。）龍泉，（中。）松陽，（中。）遂昌，（中。）青田，（中。）縉雲，（中。）慶元。（中。）","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_93","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"江東建康道肅政廉訪司","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_94","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"寧國路，（上。）唐為宣州，又為宣城郡，又升寧國軍。宋升寧國府。元至元十四年，升寧國路總管府。戶二十三萬二千五百三十八，口一百一十六萬二千六百九十。領司一、縣六。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_95","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（舊立四厢，元至元十四年，废四厢創立。）","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_96","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣六","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_97","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"宣城，（上。倚郭。）南陵，（中。）涇縣，（中。）寧國，（中。）旌德，（中。）太平。（中。）","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_98","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"徽州路，（上。）唐歙州。宋改徽州。元至元十四年，升徽州路。戶一十五萬七千四百七十一，口八十二萬四千三百四。領司一、縣五、州一。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_99","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（舊設四厢，至元十四年改置。）","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_100","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_101","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"歙縣，（上。倚郭。）休寧，（中。）祈門，（中。）黟縣，（下。）績溪。（中。）","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_102","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州一","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_103","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"婺源州，（下。）本休寧縣之回玉乡，唐析之置婺源縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_104","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"饒州路，（上。）唐改鄱陽郡，仍改饒州，宋因之。元至元十四年，升饒州路總管府。戶六十八萬二百三十五，口四百三萬六千五百七十。領司一、縣三、州三。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_105","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（舊設三厢，至元十四年改立。）","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_106","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣三","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_107","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"鄱陽，（上。倚郭。）德興，（上。）安仁。（中。）","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_108","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州三","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_109","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"餘幹州，（中。）唐以來為縣，元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_110","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"浮梁州，（中。）唐以來為縣，元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_111","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"樂平州，（中。）唐以來為縣，元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_112","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"江南諸道行御史台","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_113","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"集慶路，（上。）唐武德初，置扬州東南道行台尚書省。後复為蒋州，罢行台，移扬州江都，改金陵曰白下，以其地隸润州。貞觀中，更白下曰江寧。至德中，置江寧郡。乾元中，改升州。其後楊氏有其地，改為金陵府。南唐李氏又改為江寧府。宋平南唐，复為升州。仁宗以升王建國，升建康軍。高宗改建康府，建行都，又為沿江製置司治所。元至元十二年歸附。十四年，升建康路。初立行御史台於扬州，既而徙杭州，又徙江州，又還杭州；二十三年，自杭州徙治建康。天歷二年，以文宗潛邸，改建康路為集慶路。戶二十一萬四千五百四十八，口一百七萬二千六百九十。領司一、縣三、州二。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_114","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_115","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣三","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_116","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"上元，（中。倚郭。）江寧，（中。倚郭。）句容。（中。）","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_117","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_118","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"溧水州，（中。）唐以來皆為縣，元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_119","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"溧陽州，（中。）唐以來併為縣，元至元十六年，升為溧陽路。二十七年，复降為縣，後复升為州。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_120","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"太平路，（下。）唐置南豫州。宋為太平州。至元十四年，升為太平路。戶七萬六千二百二，口四十四萬六千三百七十一。領司一、縣三。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_121","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（舊設四厢，至元十四年改立。）","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_122","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣三","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_123","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"當涂，（中。倚郭。）芜湖，（中。）繁昌。（下。）","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_124","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"池州路，（下。）唐於秋浦縣置池州，後废，以縣隸宣州，未幾复置。宋仍為池州。元至元十四年，升為路。戶六萬八千五百四十七，口三十六萬六千五百六十七。領司一、縣六。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_125","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_126","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣六","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_127","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"貴池，（下。倚郭。即秋浦縣，吳改為貴池。）青陽，（下。）建德，（下。）銅陵，（下。）石埭，（中。）東流。（下。）","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_128","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"信州路，（上。）唐乾元以前，為衢、饒、撫、建四州之地。乾元元年，始割衢之玉山、常山，饒之弋陽及撫、建二州之地置信州。宋因之。元至元十四年，升為路。戶一十三萬二千二百九十，口六十六萬二千二百五十八。領司一、縣五。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_129","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_130","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_131","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"上饒，（上。倚郭。）玉山，（中。）弋陽，（中。）貴溪，（中。）永丰。（中。）","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_132","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"廣德路，（下。）唐初，以綏安縣置桃州，後废州，改綏安為廣德縣。宋為廣德軍。元至元十四年，升為路。戶五萬六千五百一十三，口三十三萬九千七百八十。領司一、縣二。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_133","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_134","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣二","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_135","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"廣德，（中。倚郭。）建平。（中。）","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_136","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"鉛山州，（中。）本建、撫二州之地，山產銅鉛。後唐析上饒、弋陽五乡為銅場，繼升為縣，屬信州。宋因之。元至元二十九年，割上饒之乾元、永樂二乡，弋陽之新政、善政二乡來屬，升為鉛山州，直隸行省。戶二萬六千三十五。（至順錢糧數。）","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_137","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"福建道宣慰使司都元帥府（大德元年立。）","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_138","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"福建閩海道肅政廉訪司","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_139","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"福州路，（上。）唐為閩州，後改福州，又為長樂郡，又為威武軍。宋為福建路。元至元十五年，為福州路。十八年，遷泉州行省於本州。十九年，复還泉州。二十年，仍遷本州。二十二年，併入杭州。戶七十九萬九千六百九十四，口三百八十七萬五千一百二十七。領司一、縣九、州二。州領二縣。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_140","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（至元十五年，行中書省於在城十二厢分四隅，置錄事司。十六年，併其二，置東西二司。二十年，复併為一。）","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_141","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣九","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_142","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"閩縣，（中。倚郭。）侯官，（中。倚郭。）懷安，（中。）古田，（上。）閩清，（中。）長樂，（中。）連江，（中。）羅源，（中。）永福。（中。）","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_143","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_144","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"福清州，（下。）唐析長樂八乡置萬安縣，又改福唐，又改福清。元元貞元年升為州。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_145","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"福寧州，（上。）唐長溪縣，元升為福寧州。領二縣：","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_146","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"寧德，（中。）福安。（中。）","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_147","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"建寧路，（下。）唐初為建州，又改建安郡。宋升建寧軍。元至元二十六年，升為路。戶一十二萬七千二百五十四，口五十萬六千九百二十六。領司一、縣七。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_148","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_149","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣七","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_150","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"建安，（中。）甌寧，（中。與建安俱倚郭。）浦城，（中。）建陽，（中。）崇安，（中。）松溪，（下。）政和。（下。）","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_151","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"泉州路，（上。）唐置武榮州，又改泉州。宋為平海軍。元至元十四年，立行宣慰司，兼行征南元帥府事。十五年，改宣慰司為行中書省，升泉州路總管府。十八年，遷行省於福州路。十九年，复還泉州。二十年，仍遷福州路。戶八萬九千六十，口四十五萬五千五百四十五。領司一、縣七。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_152","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（至元十五年，立南北二司。十六年，併為一。）","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_153","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣七","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_154","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"晉江，（中。倚郭。）南安，（中。）惠安，（下。）同安，（下。）永春，（下。）安溪，（下。）德化。（下。）","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_155","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"興化路，（下。）宋置太平軍，又改興化軍，先治興化，後遷莆田。元至元十四年，升興化路。戶六萬七千七百三十九，口三十五萬二千五百三十四。領司一、縣三。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_156","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_157","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣三","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_158","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"莆田，（中。宋置興化軍，遷治莆田。元至元十三年，割左右二厢屬錄事司，縣如故。）仙遊，（下。）興化。（下。軍治元在此，後移於莆田，此縣為屬邑。）","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_159","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"邵武路，（下。）唐邵武縣，屬建州。宋置邵武軍。元至元十三年，為邵武路。戶六萬四千一百二十七，口二十四萬八千七百六十一。領司一、縣四。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_160","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_161","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣四","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_162","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"邵武，（中。倚郭。）光泽，（中。）泰寧，（中。）建寧。（中。）","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_163","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"延平路，（下。）五代為延平镇，王延政始以镇為鐔州。南唐置劍州。宋以利州路亦有劍州，乃稱此為南劍州。元至元十五年，升南劍路，後改延平路。戶八萬九千八百二十五，口四十三萬五千八百六十九。領司一、縣五。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_164","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_165","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_166","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"南平，（中。倚郭。）尤溪，（中。）沙縣，（中。）順昌，（中。）將樂。（中。）","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_167","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"汀州路，（下。）唐开福、撫二州山洞置州，治新羅，後改臨汀郡，又仍為汀州。宋隸福建路。元至元十五年，升為汀州路。戶四萬一千四百二十三，口二十三萬八千一百二十七。領司一、縣六。（本路屯田二百二十五頃。）","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_168","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_169","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣六","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_170","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"長汀，（中。倚郭。）寧化，（中。）清流，（下。）莲城，（下。）上杭，（下。）武平。（下。）","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_171","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"漳州路，（下。）唐析閩州西南境置，後改漳浦郡，又复為漳州。宋因之。元至元十六年，升漳州路。戶二萬一千六百九十五，口一十萬一千三百六。領司一、縣五。（本路屯田二百五十頃。）","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_172","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_173","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_174","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"龍溪，（下。倚郭。）漳浦，（下。）龍巖，（下。）長泰，（下。）南靖。（下。本南勝，改今名。）","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_175","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"江西等處行中書省，為路一十八、州九，屬州十三，屬縣七十八。（本省馬站八十五處，水站六十九處。）","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_176","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"江西湖東道肅政廉訪司","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_177","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"龍興路，（上。）唐初為洪州，又為豫章郡，又仍為洪州。宋升隆興府。元至元十二年，設行都元帥府及安撫司，仍領南昌、新建、丰城、進賢、奉新、靖安、分寧、武寧八縣，置錄事司。十四年，改元帥府為江西道宣慰司，本路為總管府，立行中書省。十五年，立江西湖東道提刑按察司，移省於贛州。十六年，复還隆興。十七年，併入福建行省，止立宣慰司。十九年复立，罢宣慰司，隸皇太子位。二十一年，改隆興府為龍興。二十三年，丰城縣升富州，武寧縣置寧州，領武寧、分寧二縣。大德五年，以分寧縣置寧州，武寧縣隸龍興路。戶三十七萬一千四百三十六，口一百四十八萬五千七百四十四。（至元二十七年抄籍數。）領司一、縣六、州二。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_178","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（宋以南昌、新建二縣分置九厢。元至元十三年，废城內六厢，置錄事司。）","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_179","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣六","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_180","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"南昌，（上。倚郭。至元二十年，割錄事司所領城外二厢、東南兩關來屬。）新建，（上。倚郭。）進賢，（中。）奉新，（中。）靖安，（中。）武寧。（中。至元二十三年，置寧州，縣為倚郭。大德五年，於分寧縣置寧州，武寧直隸本路。）","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_181","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_182","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"富州，（上。）本富城縣，又曰丰城。唐自丰水之西徙治章水東，即今治所。宋屬隆興府。元至元十九年，隸皇太子位。二十三年，升為富州。","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_183","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"寧州，（中。）唐分寧縣。宋因之。元至元二十三年，於武寧縣置寧州，武寧為倚郭縣。大德八年，割武寧直隸本路，遂徙州治於分寧。","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_184","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"吉安路，（上。）唐為吉州，又為庐陵郡。宋升為上州。元至元十四年，升吉州路總管府，置錄事司，領一司、八縣。元貞元年，吉水、安福、太和、永新四縣升州，改吉州為吉安路。戶四十四萬四千八十三，口二百二十二萬四百一十五。領司一、縣五、州四。（大德二年，吉、贛立屯田。）","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_185","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_186","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_187","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"庐陵，（上。倚郭。）永丰，（上。）萬安，（中。）龍泉，（中。）永寧。（下。至順間，分永新州立。）","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_188","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州四","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_189","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"吉水州，（中。）舊為縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_190","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"安福州，（中。）唐初以縣置潁州，後废，复為縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_191","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"太和州，（下。）唐初置南平州，後废為縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_192","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"永新州，（下。）唐為縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_193","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"瑞州路，（上。）唐改建成縣曰高安，即其地置靖州，又改筠州。宋為高安郡，又改瑞州。元至元十四年，升瑞州路，領一司、三縣。元貞元年，升新昌縣為州。戶一十四萬四千五百七十二，口七十二萬二千三百二。領司一、縣二、州一。","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_194","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（至元十四年始立。）","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_195","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣二","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_196","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"高安，（上。倚郭。）上高。（中。）","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_197","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州一","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_198","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"新昌州，（下。）唐為建成縣，屬靖州，後省入高安。宋割高安、上高二縣地，升鹽步镇為新昌縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_199","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"袁州路，（上。）唐為袁州，又為宜春郡。元至元十三年，置安撫司。十四年，改總管府，領四縣，設錄事司，隸湖南行省。十九年，升路，隸江西行省。元貞元年，萍乡縣升州。戶一十九萬八千五百六十三，口九十九萬二千八百一十五。領司一、縣三、州一。","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_200","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（至元十三年，設兵馬司。十四年，改錄事司。）","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_201","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣三","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_202","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"宜春，（上。倚郭。）分宜，（上。）萬載。（中。）","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_203","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州一","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_204","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"萍乡州，（中。）本為縣。元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_205","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"臨江路，（上。）唐改建成為高安，而萧滩镇實高安境內。南唐升镇為清江縣，屬洪州，後又屬筠州。宋即清江縣置臨江軍，隸江南西道。元至元十三年，隸江西行都元帥府。十四年，改臨江路總管府。元貞元年，新淦、新喻二縣升州。戶一十五萬八千三百四十八，口七十九萬一千七百四十。領司一、縣一、州二。","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_206","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（宋隸都監司。元至元十三年，設兵馬司。十五年，改錄事司。）","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_207","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣一","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_208","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"清江。（上。宋即縣治置臨江軍。元至元十四年，升軍為路，而縣為倚郭。）","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_209","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_210","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"新淦州，（中。）唐以來為縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_211","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"新喻州，（中。）唐以來為縣。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_212","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"撫州路，（上。）唐初為撫州，又為臨川郡，又仍為撫州。元至元十二年，复為撫州。十四年，升撫州路總管府。戶二十一萬八千四百五十五，口一百九萬二千二百七十五。領司一、縣五。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_213","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（至元十四年，废宋三厢立。）","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_214","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_215","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"臨川，（上。）崇仁，（上。）金溪，（上。）宜黃，（中。）樂安。（中。）","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_216","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"江州路，（下。）唐初為江州，又改潯陽郡，又仍為江州。宋為定江軍。元至元十二年，置江東西宣撫司。十三年，改為江西大都督府，隸扬州行省。十四年，罢都督府，升江州路，隸龍興行都元帥府，後置行中書省，江州直隸焉。十六年，隸黃蘄等路宣慰司。二十二年，复隸行省。戶八萬三千九百七十七，口五十萬三千八百五十二。領司一、縣五。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_217","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（宋隸都監司。元至元十二年，設兵馬司。十四年，置錄事司。）","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_218","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_219","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"德化，（中。唐潯陽縣。）瑞昌，（中。）彭泽，（中。）湖口，（中。）德安。（中。）","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_220","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"南康路，（下。）唐屬江州。宋置南康軍，治星子縣。元至元十四年，升南康路，隸江淮行省。二十二年，割屬江西，領一司、三縣。戶九萬五千六百七十八，口四十七萬八千三百九十。領司一、縣二、州一。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_221","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_222","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣二","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_223","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"星子，（下。南康治所。）都昌。（上。）","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_224","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州一","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_225","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"建昌州，（下。）唐初置南昌州，後废，屬洪州。宋屬南康軍。元元貞元年升州。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_226","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"贛州路，（上。）唐初為虔州，又為南康郡，又仍為虔州。宋改贛州。元至元十四年，升贛州路總管府。十五年，設錄事司，領一司、十縣，隸江西省。二十四年，併龍南入信丰，安遠入會昌。大德元年，寧都、會昌二縣升州，割瑞金隸會昌。至大三年，复置龍南、安遠二縣，屬寧都。戶七萬一千二百八十七，口二十八萬五千一百四十八。領司一、縣五、州二。州領三縣。（本路屯田五百一十餘頃。）","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_227","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_228","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣五","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_229","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"贛縣，（上。州治所。）興國，（中。）信丰，（下。）雩都，（下。）石城。（下。）","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_230","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_231","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"寧都州，（下。）唐為縣。元大德元年，升寧都州。領二縣：","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_232","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"龍南，（下。至元二十四年，併入信丰縣。至大三年复置。）安遠。（下。至元二十四年，省入會昌縣。至大三年复置。）","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_233","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"會昌州，（下。）本雩都地。唐屬虔州。宋升縣之九州镇為會昌縣，复升為軍。元大德元年，升會昌州。領一縣：","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_234","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"瑞金。（下。舊屬虔州，大德元年來屬。）","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_235","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"建昌路，（下。）本南城縣，屬撫州。南唐升建武軍。宋升建昌軍。元至元十四年，改建昌路總管府，割南城置錄事司。十九年，南丰縣升州，直隸行省。戶九萬二千二百二十三，口五十五萬三千三百三十八。領司一、縣三。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_236","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（至元十四年立。）","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_237","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣三","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_238","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"南城，（中。）新城，（中。）廣昌。（中。）","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_239","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"南安路，（下。）唐升大庾镇為縣，屬虔州。宋以縣置南安軍。元至元十四年，改南安路總管府。十五年，割大庾縣在城四坊，設錄事司。十六年，废錄事司。戶五萬六百一十一，口三十萬三千六百六十六。領縣三：","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_240","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"大庾，（中。倚郭。）南康，（中。）上猶。（下。南唐為上猶。宋改南安。至元十六年，改永清，後复為上猶。）","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_241","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"南丰州，（下。）唐為南丰縣，隸撫州。宋改隸建昌軍。元至元十九年，升為州，直隸行省。戶二萬五千七十八，口一十二萬八千九百。","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_242","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"廣東道宣慰使司都元帥府","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_243","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"海北廣東道肅政廉訪司","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_244","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"廣州路，（上。）唐以廣州為嶺南五府節度五管經略使治所，又改南海郡，又仍為廣州。宋升為帥府。元至元十三年內附，後又叛。十五年克之，立廣東道宣慰司，立總管府併錄事司。元領八縣，而懷集一縣割屬贺州。戶一十七萬二百一十六，口一百二萬一千二百九十六。領司一、縣七。","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_245","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（至元十六年立，以州之東城、西城、子城併番禺、南海二縣在城民戶隸之。）","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_246","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣七","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_247","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"南海，（中。）番禺，（下。與南海俱倚郭。）東筦，（中。）增城，（中。）香山，（下。）新會，（下。）清遠。（下。）","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_248","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"韶州路，（下。）唐初為番州，又更名東衡州，又改韶州，又為始興郡，又仍為韶州。元至元十三年內附，未幾廣人叛，十五年始定，立總管府，設錄事司。戶一萬九千五百八十四，口一十七萬六千二百五十六。領司一、縣四。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_249","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_250","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣四","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_251","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"曲江，（中。元初分縣城西厢地及城外三厢，屬錄事司。）樂昌，（下。）仁化，（下。）乳源。（下。）","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_252","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"惠州路，（下。）唐循州。宋改惠州，又改博羅郡，又复為惠州。元至元十六年，改惠州路總管府。戶一萬九千八百三，口九萬九千一十五。領縣四：","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_253","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"歸善，（下。倚郭。）博羅，（下。）海丰，（下。）河源。（下。）","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_254","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"南雄路，（下。）本始興縣。唐初屬韶州。五代劉氏割韶之浈昌、始興二縣置雄州。宋以河北有雄州，改為南雄州。元至元十五年，改南雄路總管府。戶一萬七百九十二，口五萬三千九百六十。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_255","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"保昌，（下。本浈昌，宋改今名。）始興。（下。）","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_256","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"潮州路，（下。）唐初為潮州，又改潮陽郡，又复為潮州。元至元十五年歸附。十六年，改為總管府，以孟招讨镇守，未幾移镇漳州，土豪各據其地。二十一年，廣東道宣慰使月的迷失以兵來招諭。二十三年，复為江西等處行枢密院副使兼廣東道宣慰使以镇之，始定。戶六萬三千六百五十，口四十四萬五千五百五十。領司一、縣三。","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_257","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"錄事司。（至元二十二年始立。）","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_258","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"縣三","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_259","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"海陽，（下。倚郭。）潮陽，（下。）揭陽。（下。）","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_260","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"德慶路，（下。）唐初為南康州，又名康州，又改晉康郡。宋升德慶府。元至元十三年，徇廣東，既取廣州，而德慶未下。十四年，廣西宣慰司以兵取之，改隸廣西道。十七年，立德慶路總管府，後仍屬廣東道。戶一萬二千七百五，口三萬二千九百九十七。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_261","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"端溪，（下。）泷水。（下。）","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_262","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"肇慶路，（下。）唐初為端州，又改高要郡，又仍為端州。宋升肇慶府。元至元十三年，徇廣東，惟肇慶未附。十六年，廣南西道宣慰司定之，因隸廣西。十七年，改為下路總管府，仍屬廣東。戶三萬三千三百三十八，口五萬五千四百二十九。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_263","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"高要，（中。倚郭。）四會。（中。）","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_264","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"英德州，（下。）唐洭州。五代南漢為英州。宋升英德府。元至元十三年歸附。十五年，立英德路總管府。二十三年，降為散州。大德四年，复為路。（本州素為寇盜淵藪。大德四年，達魯花赤脱歡察兒此歲招降群盜至二千餘戶，遂升英德為路，命脱歡察兒為達魯花赤兼萬戶以镇之。）至大元年，复降為州。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_265","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"翁源。（大德五年置。）","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_266","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"梅州，（下。）唐為程乡縣，屬潮州。五代南漢置敬州。宋改梅州。元至元十三年歸附。十六年，置總管府。二十三年，改為散州。戶二千四百七十八，口一萬四千八百六十五。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_267","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"程乡。","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_268","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"南恩州，（下。）唐恩州，又為齊安郡。宋改南恩州。元至元十三年置南恩路總管府，十九年降為散州。戶一萬九千三百七十三，口九萬六千八百六十五。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_269","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"陽江，（下。）陽春。（下。）","sentenceOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_270","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"封州，（下。）唐改為臨封郡，後复為封州。元至元十三年歸附。明年，廣人叛，廣西宣慰司以兵定之，遂隸西道。十六年，立封州路總管府，後又降為散州，仍屬東道。戶二千七十七，口一萬七百四十二。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_271","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"封川，（下。）开建。（下。）","sentenceOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_272","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"新州，（下。）唐改為新昌郡，後复為新州。元至元十六年，置新州路總管府。十九年，降為散州。戶一萬一千三百一十六，口六萬七千八百九十六。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_273","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"新興。（下。）","sentenceOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_274","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"桂陽州，（下。）本桂陽縣，唐、宋因之。元至元十三年內附。十九年，升桂陽縣為散州，割連州陽山縣來屬，為蒙古忽都虎郡王分地，元隸湖南道宣慰司，後隸廣東道。戶六千三百五十六，口二萬五千六百五十五。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_275","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"陽山。（下。唐屬連州，宋因之。至元十九年割以來屬。）","sentenceOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_276","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"連州，（下。）唐改連山郡，复改連州。元至元十三年，置安撫司，直隸行中書省。十七年，废安撫司，升為連州路總管府，隸湖南道宣慰司。十九年，降為散州，隸廣東道。戶四千一百五十四，口七千一百四十一。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_277","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"連山，（下。）","sentenceOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_278","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"循州，（下。）唐改為海丰郡，仍改循州。宋為博羅郡。元至元十三年，立總管府。二十三年，降為散州。戶一千六百五十八，口八千二百九十。領縣三：","sentenceOrder":278},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_62_279","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_62","textTraditional":"龍川，（下。）興寧，（下。）長樂。（下。）","sentenceOrder":279}],"overrides":{}}